        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-11-12T13:48:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was shockingly easy, no doubt entirely thanks to the round-one Brain Burn given to Visionary. Her deck control was likewise invaluable. Everything else went about as one might expect, minus a misplay with Akash'Thriya. I do remember one really fun turn using Arc of Power off of Jade Estuary. Did a boatload of damage to the Operative. :D</p>",
