      {
        "id": 229185,
        "name": "Surgeon Cirujano",
        "username": "Surgeon_Cirujano",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/c68b51/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-11-12T17:02:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span><span><span>This one was a fun one and an easy mint despite being Advanced Chairman.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Like the others said brain burn MVP.&nbsp; This team has more than enough tricks to rule this deck.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>I had a fun two rounds of Stratosphere punching The Muscle in a row after chairman flip and no more underbosses in deck.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Ultimately Akash’s healing tempest’s AOE, Akash’s base power, and Visionary’s godly control over his deck we never felt threatened the whole match</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>(Haka just needed to punch the Thief in round one then he could have left LOL)</span></span></span></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
